    "message": "Point the live API script at tests/live/test_live_api.py\n\nThe live tests moved to tests/live/ in #59, but scripts/test-live-api.sh\nstill ran tests/integration/test_live_api.py, so pytest stopped with\n\"file or directory not found\" and ran nothing (#146). The script now\nruns the moved file and passes extra arguments to pytest, so -k can pick\none test and --collect-only can list them without calling the API. The\nlayout test fails when a script names a test file that does not exist,\nand docs/llm-integration.md describes how to run the script.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
